{"words": [{"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "Or"}, {"text": "كَٱلَّذِى", "translation": "like the one who"}, {"text": "مَرَّ", "translation": "passed"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "by"}, {"text": "قَرْيَةٍۢ", "translation": "a township"}, {"text": "وَهِىَ", "translation": "and it"}, {"text": "خَاوِيَةٌ", "translation": "(had) overturned"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "عُرُوشِهَا", "translation": "its roofs"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "أَنَّىٰ", "translation": "How"}, {"text": "يُحْىِۦ", "translation": "(will) bring to life"}, {"text": "هَـٰذِهِ", "translation": "this (town)"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بَعْدَ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَوْتِهَا ۖ", "translation": "its death"}, {"text": "فَأَمَاتَهُ", "translation": "Then he was made to die"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(by) Allah"}, {"text": "مِا۟ئَةَ", "translation": "(for) a hundred"}, {"text": "عَامٍۢ", "translation": "year(s)"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "بَعَثَهُۥ ۖ", "translation": "He raised him"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "كَمْ", "translation": "How long"}, {"text": "لَبِثْتَ ۖ", "translation": "(have) you remained"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "لَبِثْتُ", "translation": "I remained"}, {"text": "يَوْمًا", "translation": "(for) a day"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "بَعْضَ", "translation": "a part"}, {"text": "يَوْمٍۢ ۖ", "translation": "(of) a day"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "بَل", "translation": "Nay"}, {"text": "لَّبِثْتَ", "translation": "you (have) remained"}, {"text": "مِا۟ئَةَ", "translation": "one hundred"}, {"text": "عَامٍۢ", "translation": "year(s)"}, {"text": "فَٱنظُرْ", "translation": "Then look"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "at"}, {"text": "طَعَامِكَ", "translation": "your food"}, {"text": "وَشَرَابِكَ", "translation": "and your drink"}, {"text": "لَمْ", "translation": "(they did) not"}, {"text": "يَتَسَنَّهْ ۖ", "translation": "change with time"}, {"text": "وَٱنظُرْ", "translation": "and look"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "at"}, {"text": "حِمَارِكَ", "translation": "your donkey"}, {"text": "وَلِنَجْعَلَكَ", "translation": "and We will make you"}, {"text": "ءَايَةًۭ", "translation": "a sign"}, {"text": "لِّلنَّاسِ ۖ", "translation": "for the people"}, {"text": "وَٱنظُرْ", "translation": "And look"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "at"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِظَامِ", "translation": "the bones"}, {"text": "كَيْفَ", "translation": "how"}, {"text": "نُنشِزُهَا", "translation": "We raise them"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "نَكْسُوهَا", "translation": "We cover them"}, {"text": "لَحْمًۭا ۚ", "translation": "(with) flesh"}, {"text": "فَلَمَّا", "translation": "Then when"}, {"text": "تَبَيَّنَ", "translation": "became clear"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "to him"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "he said"}, {"text": "أَعْلَمُ", "translation": "I know"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "(is) on"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "every"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍۢ", "translation": "thing"}, {"text": "قَدِيرٌۭ", "translation": "All-Powerful"}], "sahih": "Or [consider such an example] as the one who passed by a township which had fallen into ruin. He said, \"How will Allāh bring this to life after its death?\" So Allāh caused him to die for a hundred years; then He revived him. He said, \"How long have you remained?\" He [the man] said, \"I have remained a day or part of a day.\" He said, \"Rather, you have remained one hundred years. Look at your food and your drink; it has not changed with time. And look at your donkey; and We will make you a sign for the people. And look at the bones [of this donkey] - how We raise them and then We cover them with flesh.\" And when it became clear to him, he said, \"I know that Allāh is over all things competent.\""}